WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.976 --> 00:00:06.064
KANG
You're an interesting man, Scott Lang.

00:00:08.222 --> 00:00:09.459
You're an Avenger...

00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:12.146
SCOTT LANG
[Grunting]

00:00:13.492 --> 00:00:14.514
KANG
...you have a daughter...

00:00:16.352 --> 00:00:18.920
...but you've lost a lot of time, like me.

00:00:21.932 --> 00:00:23.357
We can help each other with that.

00:00:26.357 --> 00:00:26.944
CASSIE LANG
Dad!

00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:32.407
SCOTT LANG
Who are you?

00:00:33.576 --> 00:00:35.668
KANG
I'm the man who can give you

00:00:35.726 --> 00:00:37.287
the one thing you want.

00:00:38.669 --> 00:00:39.556
SCOTT LANG
What's that?

00:00:40.184 --> 00:00:41.132
KANG
Time.

00:00:41.817 --> 00:00:43.817
♪♪

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:48.280
JANET VAN DYNE
He can re-write existence...

00:00:50.068 --> 00:00:51.768
...and shatter timelines.

00:00:54.232 --> 00:00:55.597
You cannot trust him!

00:00:56.662 --> 00:00:57.908
SCOTT LANG
I don't care who this guy is.

00:00:58.533 --> 00:00:59.710
I just lost so much.

00:01:00.056 --> 00:01:00.819
YOUNG CASSIE LANG
Daddy!

00:01:02.735 --> 00:01:04.364
SCOTT LANG 
He can give us a second chance.

00:01:14.657 --> 00:01:16.458
KANG
Let me make this easy for you.

00:01:18.353 --> 00:01:19.663
You will bring me what I need...

00:01:21.221 --> 00:01:23.542
...or everything you call a life...

00:01:24.098 --> 00:01:24.776
...will end.

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:32.826
CASSIE LANG
This is all my fault.

00:01:37.139 --> 00:01:38.849
KANG
You may not want her to watch this.

00:01:39.071 --> 00:01:40.408
SCOTT LANG
We had a deal.

00:01:50.346 --> 00:01:51.261
KANG
You thought you could win?!

00:01:56.234 --> 00:01:57.284
SCOTT LANG
I don't have to win...

00:01:59.577 --> 00:02:01.179
...we both just have to lose.

00:02:03.357 --> 00:02:03.941
CASSIE LANG
Dad!

00:02:05.361 --> 00:02:06.585
SCOTT LANG
I'm sorry Cassie!

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:09.304
KANG
[Screaming]

00:02:09.354 --> 00:02:11.354
♪♪

